-- 0603 — bank details from the September salary sheets and the Bank of AJK invoice
--
-- Shayan, 29 Oct 2026: "extract this data and add to employees if no conflict
-- arises" — All Salary Sheets Sep 2026.xlsx (Emaar, HMC, Misc, MIU, MIMC/MoTH/
-- Lexus, Head Office, Nova) and GGS_BAJK_Invoice_Sep2026.xlsx. The rows below
-- were read from those files; nothing here was typed by hand.
--
-- Each row: [ref, sheet, name, cnic, sheet id, client hint, bank, account,
--            iban, iban generated (1/0), branch, other holder, father's name]
--
-- Rules, as agreed:
--   * Matched by CNIC, then the sheet's ID (legacy_code, e.g. EMR-053 /
--     HMC-048), then by name — a name match only when exactly one active
--     employee of that name is under the sheet's client.
--   * Account title = the employee's own name, unless the sheet names another
--     holder (a relative's account).
--   * Askari (Emaar / HMC / Head Office / Wusat plain numbers): no IBAN; branch
--     = the first three digits. Generated IBANs only for MCB (16-digit account =
--     IBAN body) and HBL (14 digits, padded 00) — a generated IBAN passes the
--     checksum whether or not it is the account, so no other bank is guessed.
--   * Bank of AJK: account = the computerized account, else the old ledger
--     number (CD-/PLS-/BMBA-); branch = the branch code; "advice" rows skipped.
--     Its CNIC and father's name fill those blanks too (a CNIC already held by
--     another employee is not copied).
--   * BLANKS ONLY. An employee whose stored account differs from the sheet's
--     is a CONFLICT and is not touched at all. Accounts compare on their digits
--     without leading zeros (Bastion holds some Askari numbers with a leading
--     0; an IBAN compares on its 16-digit body). Where Bastion already holds the
--     same IBAN as the sheet, it is the same account whatever the number field
--     says (Allied and NBP numbers are stored shorter than their IBAN body).
--
-- Asserted on what can break: every employee written now holds the sheet's
-- account; no conflicted employee changed; no field that held a value before
-- holds a different one after. A replay finds every row already filled and
-- writes nothing.

